  ("Weekly video calls with my parents have become a habit.", "Ota-onam bilan haftalik videoqo'ng'iroqlar bir odatga aylandi."),
  ("Because I visit home often, the homesickness has stayed manageable.", "Uyga tez-tez tashrif buyurganim uchun sog'inch boshqarsa bo'ladigan darajada qoldi."),
  ("I've put down new roots here, so I live with a sense of belonging to two places.", "Bu yerda yangi ildizlar otdim, shuning uchun ikki tomonga mansublik tuyg'usi bilan yashayman."),
  ("Leaving was a conscious choice, and I've never had second thoughts.", "Ketish ongli tanlov edi va hech qachon fikrimdan qaytmaganman."),
  ("After coming back for good, readjusting was even harder than leaving.", "Butunlay qaytgandan keyin qayta moslashuv ketishdan ham qiyinroq bo'ldi."),
  ("The skills I gained abroad have increased my market value.", "Chet elda orttirilgan ko'nikmalar bozordagi qiymatimni oshirdi."),
  ("I look back on the road I've traveled with gratitude and am getting ready for the next stage.", "Bosib o'tilgan yo'lga minnatdorlik bilan qarayman va keyingi bosqichga tayyorlanyapman."),
  ("My advice to those who are leaving: don't compare everything to your home country. (plural)", "Ketayotganlarga maslahatim: hamma narsani o'z vataningiz bilan taqqoslamang."),
